  "✏️s/🔌️plugins/🖍️draw/🔄️fsm": "→ 🗿️artifacts/draw/🏅️standards/🔖️1/⚙️engine/fsm/; the nested ✨️macros sub-crate needs a crate-boundary specialist, not a plain directory move — 📓️w0-b-plugin-shape.md §5.",
